    topic: "Huqúqu'lláh",
    title: "Ḥuqúqu’lláh is indeed a great law. It is incumbent upon all…",
    author: "Bahá’u’lláh",
    text: "Ḥuqúqu’lláh is indeed a great law. It is incumbent upon all to make this offering, because it is the source of grace, abundance, and of all good. It is a bounty which shall remain with every soul in every world of the worlds of God, the All-Possessing, the All-Bountiful.",
